{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_07_beg","storyGroup":"act42side","storySort":15,"storyDependence":"act42side_level_act42side_06_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"MT-7","storyName":"丧礼","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"被带进育婴圣堂的非萨科塔，被告知拉特兰将为他们赋予光环。一些人试图反对，却被强制要求接受光环。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act42side/level_act42side_07_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act42side_07","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":13,"next":15,"characters":["保育员","席德佳","紧张的修女","黎博利公民","潘格尼尼","帕特里奇昂","莫斯提马","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_bg_61_g4_nurseryindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#11$1","duration":"0.7","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_370_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"charslot","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"二位，就是这里了，请稍作休息。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"......我以为，配合调查阿尔图罗小姐越狱的事情，应该要去公证所或者大教堂。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"领二位来的铳骑有事先走了。他托我转告二位，阿尔图罗的事情，请不必担心。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"一直以来，兰登修道院的各位都在尽责尽职地守护圣城，我们不会因为一个犯人越狱，就过多苛责。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_370_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的修女","text":"呼，那就好那就好。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_370_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"我们请二位来，是有别的事情要商量。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"这里好多——","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"您希望换个安静点的地方吗？","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"不，我的意思是，这间育婴室里......为什么全是黎博利？","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_365_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_367_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":36},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1254_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1255_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":41},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_comfortbell","volume":"1","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"席德佳看向前方，着装各异的黎博利们或站或坐，没多少人说话，唯有安抚铃的声音稳定地响着。","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"几百？成千？上万？席德佳数不清了，或许一整个城市的黎博利都在眼前。","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"这间育婴室有这么大吗？不，怎样的场合，需要聚集如此多的黎博利？","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"保育员先生，你们是不是还有一间房里全是佩洛，一间房里全是菲林，一间房里全是鲁珀......","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"您很聪明。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"我们也为堕天使和萨卡兹准备了专门的房间。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"......呃，您很坦然嘛。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"毕竟育婴圣堂并没有在做什么见不得人的事情。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"降生仪式的最后，教皇厅已经宣布，萨科塔将向所有种族分享光环。以种族为单位，操作起来是最方便的。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"......","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_370_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的修女","text":"......","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_370_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":62},{"type":"charslot","id":63},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"cr","id":64},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","channel":"cr","fadetime":"3.5","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_365_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"黎博利公民","text":"保育员先生，你是说，我们真的也能拥有光环？也能像萨科塔那样互相感受？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_365_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"正如您在降生仪式上感受那只小木攀兽的心跳。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"为什么呢？","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"什么？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我说，我为什么，要拥有光环呢？","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"1.5","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":84},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"所以说，把我带到这里，压根不是为梵里妮的事情，而是因为......我是个黎博利？","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"是的。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"很快，我也能拥有你脑袋顶上的这圈日光灯？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"进去吧，潘。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"哟，看来我没有拒绝的权利呀。而且，听起来是一件大好事，对吧？","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"起码对你的眼睛有好处。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"那可不止吧！","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"要是当初我有光环，是不是就能知道你把吉雅赶出拉特兰的时候，你那铁皮脑袋底下是什么心情了？","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"我知道你埋怨我，潘。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"很有自知之明。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"如果没发生那件事，你或许不会沦落到如今的地步。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"拉特兰千百年的历史上，有很多人尝试过复刻典籍中描述的那把恐怖的大口径转管遗产铳......成功的只有你。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"那种默认使用者能承受远超常规铳械五倍后坐力的设计，真是天才又疯癫......","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"行了，你在没穿戴铳骑甲胄之前，就成功试验了我的设计，你是在变相夸自己是天生的铳骑吗？","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"我当时只觉得自己是你天生的搭档。你、我、吉雅，从小学到大学，我们一直都是最好的朋友。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"可我正式成为铳骑的第一项任务，却是把吉雅驱逐出拉特兰......","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"在那之后，你辞去了铳骑专属制铳师的职务，在我不知道的地方开了一家小工坊，如今又......","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"我是自愿退休的，行不行？*拉特兰俚语*的“制铳圣堂”，要是你们萨科塔都把制铳当作生产薯片，那我还掺和什么？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"不是萨科塔有罪，是吗？吉雅要被赶出去，我要被套上光环......就没有黎博利能在拉特兰好好活着？","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"那件事和吉雅是不是黎博利没有关系。哪怕她是萨科塔，她感染了矿石病，拉特兰也不容——","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":122},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"你知道个屁！","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"不就是什么“拉特兰的秩序”“拉特兰的纯洁”吗？这些话我从你嘴里听过多少次了？","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"但这话你自己信吗？你想想吉雅是怎么一个人死在外面的，你*拉特兰俚语*信吗？","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"......","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"我承认，我自己曾经信。直到那个时候，帕特里奇昂......","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"我们曾一起宿醉，一起玩铳，一起哭一起笑，我们自诩全拉特兰没有人的酒杯碰得比我们的响。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"但直到吉雅的背影消失在荒野尽头，你就那么从我旁边转身回拉特兰的时候，我才意识到......","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"我们从来没有真正交流过。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_bg_61_g4_nurseryindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":140},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"席德佳修女，光环可不是恶物，它是拉特兰对我们的赐福。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我知道。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"从最初循着驮兽而来的流民开始，黎博利就始终在向萨科塔学习，从生活习惯到思维方式，无所不学。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"黎博利向往美好的生活，也渴望成为圣城的一部分，我们有目共睹。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我知道。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"不久前，我才刚和阿尔图罗小姐讲起过这段历史。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"可唯有萨科塔头顶上的光环，黎博利怎么都无法习得。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"也正因为如此，一直以来，萨科塔与生活在拉特兰的其他种族之间，始终都存在一些无法调和的矛盾。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"你们无从参与萨科塔的共感，你们会苦恼自己的信仰是否毫无根基，你们会质疑拉特兰的冷漠与疏离......","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"席德佳修女，您此前为了解决兰登修道院的财务危机，常年不在拉特兰，所以对这种情况缺乏一些认知。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"您可以回头问问其他的黎博利......","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我知道。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我知道在这里生活的很多异族人都羡慕你们的共感。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"所以接下来，我们将向每一个人分享它。它会让我们不再有误会，不再有分歧，让我们真正理解彼此，消弭矛盾和隔阂......","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"让黎博利，真正成为拉特兰不可分割的一部分。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"......","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我只觉得难过。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"什么？","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我从小在这座城市长大，知道哪家店做的甜品不甜，哪条巷子的流浪云兽爱吃南瓜，哪栋楼的天台适合看星星。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"在兰登修道院的日子，我和萨科塔修女们一起酿啤酒做面包，分头跑到其他国家拉投资，又在回来聚会的时候喝得酩酊大醉......","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我偷拍她们睡觉时翅膀穿过椅背的滑稽样子，她们在我偷溜出去的时候在教堂里放安眠曲，好让主教多打一会儿盹......","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_370_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的修女","text":"哈哈，席德佳，我还记得。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_370_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的修女","text":"其实主教早就发现了来着，他只是舍不得责怪你。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_370_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"保育员先生，我是个拉特兰人。我很喜欢这里，很喜欢很喜欢。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"您说得没错，我确实很多时候都发现自己在状况外，我不懂为什么在同僚的葬礼上，萨科塔们哭着哭着就笑着唱起了歌......","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"但......","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我爸爸是个猎户，每年冬天，他都会和其他人结伴，进山打猎。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"他告诉我，哪怕是相处了十来年的老伙计，也会在发现同一个猎物时有不同的主意，甚至吵起来。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"人和人本来就是不一样的，这和我们有没有光环没有关系。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"可是您刚刚跟我说，我要获得光环，才能真正成为拉特兰的一分子。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"您是在说，我过去二十多年，都不算是个真正的拉特兰人？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"还是在说，我所有的生活，都只是一种不够完美的模仿？","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"确实如此，席德佳修女，但这并不是对您或其他任何黎博利的否定。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"这只是一种必要的，对拉特兰的肯定。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"保育员先生，我不在乎什么否定和肯定。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我只是不觉得我和我的生活有什么错。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"更不觉得自己有什么理由要接受这种所谓的“赐福”。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"......","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"0.7","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1788_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1789_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":208},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":211,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1786_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"这是拉特兰的决定，席德佳修女。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1786_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"charslot","id":217},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"那是我第一次感受到离别的滋味，潘。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"......并不好受。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"......","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"啧，打那起，我的人生就开始不对劲了。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"就像那种爆米花电影，哈哈，《电锯侠》系列，或者《蓝桥遗梦》系列，一个桥段成了经典，开始反反复复地出现。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"吉雅之后是你，再之后是我最器重的学生，出于某些原因，我亲手将她驱逐出拉特兰。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"还有小菲，也没有多让人省心......","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"怎么，你还担心哪天你的孙女跑了，自己变成孤寡老人？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"你们有各自的问题，我尝试过做些什么，但好像什么都做不了。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"呵。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"你那是尝试，还是自我欺骗、自我安慰？","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"也许都是吧。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"不过你刚刚说错了一件事，希望每一个人都拥有光环，并不仅仅是为了守护所谓“圣城的秩序和纯洁”......","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"这说得好像拉特兰是个有种族洁癖的国家一样。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"共享光环的拉特兰，将成为一个真正的整体，连某种无从想象的、威胁全泰拉的灾厄都能够解决。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"那样的拉特兰，自然也能够解决我们所遭遇的一切问题，包括......","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"好了，交心时间结束。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"*拉特兰俚语*，你也总算说完了。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"又一次从你嘴里听到这些鬼话，真恶心。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"潘，进去吧。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"如果我拒绝呢？","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"我可不想要你头顶那发光的玩意，我对理解你的苦心一点兴趣都没有。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":257},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sldrpllgn","volume":"1","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"n","id":260},{"type":"text","text":"潘格尼尼向铳骑举起了自己手中的铳。","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"再等等吧。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"什么？","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"我承认你是个天才的制铳师，可你是个黎博利，潘。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"你没法使用自己亲手打造的这些铳。它们在你手里，只是一张张名片。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"如果你真的对我那么不满，真的想要赏我一颗子弹，你恰恰应该等到仪式结束。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"到了那时，你拥有了光环，也就拥有了使用它的资格——","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":272},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_speardrop","volume":"1","id":273},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_maskbreak","volume":"1","delay":"0.2","id":274},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"潘格尼尼重重地将铳砸在了铳骑的甲胄上，碎屑纷飞，断裂的铳托摔出去好远，沉闷的嗡响在走廊里久久回荡。","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"......","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":281},{"type":"charslot","id":282},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"0.7","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1788_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":285},{"type":"charslot","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1781_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"潘格尼尼","text":"......","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FE/Avg_avg_npc_1781_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕特里奇昂","text":"潘，进去吧。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_4194_rmixer_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#11$1","duration":"0.7","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1","duration":"0.7","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":302},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"charslot","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1785_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"万国信使莫斯提马，“监管人”菲亚梅塔。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"二位辛苦，感谢二位为拉特兰的付出。现在，请移步......","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_213_mostma_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫斯提马","text":"移步到那些已经被塞满了人的育婴室？","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_213_mostma_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1785_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"仪式很快就要开始了，牧首将率先为在拉特兰栖居已久的黎博利启圣。之后，堕天使破碎的光环与光翼也将得到修补。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"保育员","text":"还请二位尽快动身，我会为二位引路......","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EE/Avg_avg_npc_1785_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":313},{"type":"dialog","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$5","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"100,0","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","afrom":"0","ato":"0","duration":"0","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$5","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1","duration":"0","focus":"m","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","isblock":"true","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","focus":"m","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","isblock":"true","id":317},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp5","volume":"0.7","id":318},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.3","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":322},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.7","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":325},{"type":"charslot","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$5","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"1","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1041_angel2_1#9$5","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"嘿。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/51/Avg_avg_1041_angel2_1-9$5.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":333},{"type":"charslot","id":334},{"type":"image","id":335}],"characters":["保育员","席德佳","紧张的修女","黎博利公民","潘格尼尼","帕特里奇昂","莫斯提马","？？？"]}